@baseUrl = https://your-app.test
@token = your-bearer-token

### List all page SEO entries
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content/page-seo
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show homepage SEO
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content/page-seo/homepage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Show custom page SEO
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/content/page-seo/my-custom-page
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
